{"type":"message","id":"b9634ee8","parentId":"9b75732e","timestamp":"2026-02-19T11:47:18.445Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-02-19 19:47 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 增强\"技能安全审计\"功能：\n\n1. 查看当前 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/skill-audit/ 的结构\n\n2. 添加新的审计规则到 rules/ 目录：\n   - rules/web.yaml: Web 安全规则（SQL注入、XSS等）\n   - rules/crypto.yaml: 加密货币相关规则\n\n3. 更新 scanner.js 添加对新规则类型的支持\n\n4. 添加一个快速扫描脚本 quick-audit.sh\n\n实际创建/修改相关文件。"}],"timestamp":1771501638443}}
